#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/01-architecture.md:42
#: 16607a3b9a1e43a4bf55706d7c0f8043
msgid ""
"FreeSWITCH is one softswitch process that terminates signaling and media,"
" executes a dialplan, and emits events. Callers are SIP phones, trunks, "
"and WebRTC browsers. Operators edit XML and use `fs_cli`. Application "
"code either embeds (Lua/Python/V8 modules) or sits **outside** the "
"process on the Event Socket (ESL). SignalWire is an optional cloud peer "
"via `mod_signalwire`."
msgstr ""
"FreeSWITCH 是一个软交换进程：终结信令与媒体、执行拨号计划并发送事件。呼叫方是 SIP 话机、中继和 WebRTC 浏览器。运维人员编辑"
" XML 并使用 `fs_cli`。应用代码要么嵌入进程（Lua/Python/V8 模块），要么通过 Event "
"Socket（ESL）运行在进程**之外**。SignalWire 是可选的云端对等体，经由 `mod_signalwire`。"

