#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/01-architecture.md:132
#: 8763a39a3b1248f696e5076e33e7d616
msgid ""
"**Important dependencies**: bundled APR (`libs/apr`), SQLite, "
"`libs/srtp`, `libs/libvpx`."
msgstr "**重要依赖**：捆绑的 APR（`libs/apr`）、SQLite、`libs/srtp`、`libs/libvpx`。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/01-architecture.md:133
#: 4fb6cac5e7e74379ae5eed8aa8af48e2
msgid ""
"**Failure modes**: init aborts if APR or SQLite cannot start; "
"`SCF_NO_NEW_SESSIONS` is set until the core is ready."
msgstr "**失败模式**：APR 或 SQLite 无法启动则初始化中止；核心就绪前会设置 `SCF_NO_NEW_SESSIONS`。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/01-architecture.md:135
#: 4ed75d6f7fd243c38ccad6edb4738532
msgid "XML configuration"
msgstr "XML 配置"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/01-architecture.md:137
#: 4625eb9fbdb44062b528be6a07fe99d5
msgid ""
"**Responsibilities**: parse `conf_dir/freeswitch.xml`, expand "
"preprocessor includes (`X-PRE-PROCESS` / `#include` / `#set`), serve "
"sections (`configuration`, `dialplan`, `directory`, `languages`, "
"`chatplan`). `mod_xml_curl` / `mod_xml_ldap` can replace file-backed "
"sections at runtime by installing `switch_xml_set_open_root_function()`."
msgstr ""
"**职责**：解析 `conf_dir/freeswitch.xml`，展开预处理器 include（`X-PRE-PROCESS` / "
"`#include` / "
"`#set`），提供各节（`configuration`、`dialplan`、`directory`、`languages`、`chatplan`）。`mod_xml_curl`"
" / `mod_xml_ldap` 可通过安装 `switch_xml_set_open_root_function()` "
"在运行时替换基于文件的节。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/01-architecture.md:138
#: 10092c46ae544b37a5de1bce8eba9cde
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"**Key entry points**: `src/switch_xml.c` (`switch_xml_open_root`, "
"`__switch_xml_open_root`, `switch_xml_open_cfg`, `switch_xml_locate`), "
"root document `conf/vanilla/freeswitch.xml`."
msgstr ""
"**关键入口**：`src/switch_xml.c`（`switch_xml_open_root`、`__switch_xml_open_root`），根文档"
" `conf/vanilla/freeswitch.xml`。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/01-architecture.md:139
#: 197c932faaae4ef9854384b6747d66f1
msgid ""
"**Lookup**: `switch_xml_open_cfg(\"modules.conf\", …)` does **not** open "
"that filename. It locates `section name=\"configuration\"` then a child "
"`configuration` whose `name` attribute equals the string (`modules.conf`,"
" `switch.conf`, `sofia.conf`, …). Vanilla stitches those files in via `X"
"-PRE-PROCESS cmd=\"include\" data=\"autoload_configs/*.xml\"` "
"(`conf/vanilla/freeswitch.xml`). XML bindings (`mod_xml_curl`) run first;"
" if none return a tree, the in-memory root (`MAIN_XML_ROOT`) is used."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/01-architecture.md:140
#: df052020a93f439983b63df5d826fc71
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Compiled artifact**: `log_dir/freeswitch.xml.fsxml` (comment in "
"`conf/vanilla/freeswitch.xml`: `${prefix}/log/freeswitch.xml.fsxml`). "
"Memory-mapped while running — do not edit it."
msgstr ""
"**编译产物**：`log_dir/freeswitch.xml.fsxml`（`conf/vanilla/freeswitch.xml` "
"注释写的是 `${prefix}/log/freeswitch.xml.fsxml`）。运行时内存映射 — 不要编辑。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/01-architecture.md:141
#: b0e8dc916f374f45afbb0962d813d2c8
msgid ""
"**Failure modes**: broken include path or XML error leaves the switch "
"unable to open root (`\"Cannot Open log directory or XML Root!\"`). A "
"missing `modules.conf` configuration node logs `open of modules.conf "
"failed` and continues; if **no** `<load>` entries were seen across "
"pre/common/post lists, the loader falls back to loading every DSO in "
"`mod_dir`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/01-architecture.md:143
#: aeec3540e38b44c78a27083016a5f3c9
msgid "Session, channel, state machine"
msgstr "会话、通道与状态机"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/01-architecture.md:145
#: daec607b720146878886fd234b393492
msgid ""
"**Responsibilities**: each call leg is a `switch_core_session_t` (thread,"
" codecs, queues, UUID) wrapping a `switch_channel_t` (state, variables, "
"cause). The core runs `switch_state_handler_table` hooks; endpoints "
"override them (Sofia’s `sofia_on_init` / `sofia_on_routing`)."
msgstr ""
"**职责**：每个呼叫腿是一个 `switch_core_session_t`（线程、编解码器、队列、UUID），内部包裹 "
"`switch_channel_t`（状态、变量、原因）。核心运行 `switch_state_handler_table` "
"钩子；端点可覆盖它们（Sofia 的 `sofia_on_init` / `sofia_on_routing`）。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/01-architecture.md:146
#: 6920c6156d1b43de93ad363d819713fe
msgid ""
"**Key entry points**: `src/switch_core_session.c`, "
"`src/switch_channel.c`, `src/switch_core_state_machine.c`, types in "
"`src/include/switch_types.h` (`switch_channel_state_t`)."
msgstr ""
"**关键入口**：`src/switch_core_session.c`、`src/switch_channel.c`、`src/switch_core_state_machine.c`，类型在"
" `src/include/switch_types.h`（`switch_channel_state_t`）。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/01-architecture.md:147
#: a49a1567700a478b86c69817962a6118
msgid ""
"**Failure modes**: hung sessions if an endpoint returns without advancing"
" state; media/proxy flags (`CF_PROXY_MODE`, `CF_PROXY_MEDIA`) change "
"SDP/RTP ownership."
msgstr ""
"**失败模式**：端点返回却不推进状态会导致会话挂起；媒体/代理标志（`CF_PROXY_MODE`、`CF_PROXY_MEDIA`）会改变 "
"SDP/RTP 所有权。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/01-architecture.md:149
#: 5cb8a721ce084bc38b1588f8c511c6b4
msgid ""
"Default inbound path after create: `CS_NEW` → `CS_INIT` → `CS_ROUTING` "
"(dialplan hunt) → `CS_EXECUTE` (apps) → `CS_EXCHANGE_MEDIA` or hangup "
"path `CS_HANGUP` → `CS_REPORTING` → `CS_DESTROY`."
msgstr ""
"创建后的默认入局路径：`CS_NEW` → `CS_INIT` → `CS_ROUTING`（拨号计划查找）→ `CS_EXECUTE`（应用）→"
" `CS_EXCHANGE_MEDIA`，或挂断路径 `CS_HANGUP` → `CS_REPORTING` → `CS_DESTROY`。"

