#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/01-architecture.md:851
#: fc3b0db1892644929fdf21992d8bc4a1
msgid ""
"This is the plugin architecture. FreeSWITCH does **not** read an IDL, "
"protobuf, or GObject type file to discover what a module can do. After "
"`dlopen`, the module’s **load function runs in-process and pushes C "
"function pointers plus names into a core registry**. Later, dialplan XML,"
" `fs_cli`, originate, and the media layer only do **string → hash lookup "
"→ call the pointer**. That is C-style dependency injection plus a service"
" locator: providers register; consumers look up by name."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/01-architecture.md:853
#: 848fad5174cc461f84c4e21732b0fa0c
msgid ""
"`libfreeswitch` owns sessions, the `CS_*` state machine, media, XML, and "
"the event bus. Modules extend those surfaces; they do not fork the core. "
"Same ABI, same headers (`src/include/switch.h`), same address space — so "
"the function pointer **is** the interface. Skeleton: "
"`src/mod/applications/mod_skel/mod_skel.c`. Types: `switch_types.h`, "
"`switch_loadable_module.h`, `switch_module_interfaces.h`. Container of "
"hashes: `struct switch_loadable_module_container loadable_modules` in "
"`src/switch_loadable_module.c`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/01-architecture.md:862
#: b1cfaff0ac6446efb399bfabdc0cb3ee
msgid "Discover the file, then the entry symbol"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/01-architecture.md:864
#: 9738efb77c934bea8bb29b9ed4c6f910
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Phase 1 is XML, not reflection: `<load module=\"mod_sofia\"/>` → "
"`{mod_dir}/mod_sofia.so` → `switch_dso_open` (`dlopen` / "
"`LoadLibraryEx`). Detail: [Runtime load tag](#runtime-load-tag)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/01-architecture.md:866
#: 389efc4cd2c14c4fb7cb16b87166905b
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Phase 2 is a **C symbol**. `SWITCH_MODULE_DEFINITION(mod_example, "
"mod_example_load, shutdown, runtime)` expands to "
"`mod_example_module_interface` of type "
"`switch_loadable_module_function_table_t`: `{ SWITCH_API_VERSION, load, "
"shutdown, runtime, flags }` (`switch_types.h`). "
"`switch_loadable_module_load_file` `dlsym`s that name, checks "
"`SWITCH_API_VERSION` (currently **5**), then calls "
"`load(&module_interface, pool)`. A mismatch logs *Trying to load an out "
"of date module*. `runtime` may be `NULL` (Sofia has no core module-"
"runtime thread)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/01-architecture.md:868
#: dfb96ac308c94a1a81d19e128e2019a1
msgid "There is no separate “plugin manifest” beside that exported table."
