msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/01-architecture.md:897
#: a3419bd2fd8040158508dfc6759b85f4
msgid ""
"`mod_dptools` registers the dialplan name `bridge` as "
"`audio_bridge_function` (not a direct export of "
"`switch_ivr_multi_threaded_bridge`; that helper is called from inside the"
" app). Same module registers `\"answer\"` → `answer_function` "
"(`SAF_SUPPORT_NOMEDIA`). `mod_commands` registers API `\"status\"` → "
"`status_function`. Sofia registers endpoint `\"sofia\"` plus APIs "
"`sofia`, `sofia_contact`, apps `sofia_sla`, chat `SOFIA_CHAT_PROTO`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/01-architecture.md:899
#: 28d8701948334be29dd37417a3b9d347
msgid ""
"The dialplan XML never names `mod_dptools`. Consumers look up **interface"
" type + name** (`APPLICATION` + `\"answer\"`). The module is only the "
"capability container; ownership is `parent` on the interface struct for "
"unload/refcount."
