"(defer A-leg codec until after dialplan). `inbound-bypass-media` sets "
"`CF_PROXY_MODE` (RTP endpoint-to-endpoint); `inbound-proxy-media` sets "
"`CF_PROXY_MEDIA` (RTP through the server without payload inspection)."
