"scoreboard is internal (disable with `-nosql`). Channel recovery flags "
"`CF_RECOVERING` skip routing and jump to `CS_EXECUTE`."
msgstr ""
"**一致性**：一个会话线程拥有通道状态机。SQL 记分板是内部的（用 `-nosql` 禁用）。通道恢复标志 `CF_RECOVERING` "
"会跳过路由并跳到 `CS_EXECUTE`。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/01-architecture.md:1131
#: a5d29f817f5543969a393b74a26a8a69
msgid ""
"**Retry / compensation**: SIP retransmits are Sofia/Sofia-SIP’s job. "
"Dialplan `bridge` failover is application-level (pipe-separated "
"gateways), not a core saga. ESL clients must not block the event thread."
msgstr ""
"**重试 / 补偿**：SIP 重传是 Sofia/Sofia-SIP 的职责。拨号计划 `bridge` "
"故障转移是应用层（管道分隔的网关），不是核心 saga。ESL 客户端不得阻塞事件线程。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/01-architecture.md:1133
#: c6226a75f7cb4a8dae7708a37819f8c6
msgid "Outbound originate"
msgstr "出局 originate"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/01-architecture.md:1135
#: 3e09de9b8ae34ec1879c7e992ee91e93
msgid ""
"`switch_ivr_originate()` allocates an outbound session through the named "
"endpoint (`sofia/gateway/...`, `loopback/...`), runs the same state table"
" with `TFLAG_OUTBOUND` so `sofia_on_init` sends INVITE via "
"`sofia_glue_do_invite()`."
msgstr ""
"`switch_ivr_originate()` "
"通过指定端点（`sofia/gateway/...`、`loopback/...`）分配出局会话，以 `TFLAG_OUTBOUND` "
"运行同一状态表，因此 `sofia_on_init` 会经由 `sofia_glue_do_invite()` 发送 INVITE。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/01-architecture.md:1137
#: 7eee50cd952849818a9ab6e8495f1065
msgid "ESL control"
msgstr "ESL 控制"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/01-architecture.md:1139
#: f2f2ab5ad90d4d27a6cf4832c7c60be1
msgid ""
"Client connects to 8021, authenticates, then `api` / `bgapi` / `event` / "
"`sendmsg` (uuid). Health check used by Docker: `fs_cli -x status` must "
"match `^UP`."
msgstr ""
"客户端连接 8021、鉴权，然后 `api` / `bgapi` / `event` / `sendmsg`（uuid）。Docker "
"使用的健康检查：`fs_cli -x status` 必须匹配 `^UP`。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/01-architecture.md:1141
#: 40d06def61dd4bdb9949b79c69fe0db5
msgid "Cross-Cutting Concerns"
msgstr "横切关注点"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/01-architecture.md:1143
#: 3cb23f3fb27a419589472c772c642f1c
msgid ""
"**Authentication and authorization**: SIP digest + ACL lists "
"(`conf/vanilla/autoload_configs/acl.conf.xml`, Sofia `apply-inbound-"
"acl`). ESL password in `event_socket.conf.xml` (default `ClueCon`); "
"vanilla binds to wildcard `::` with its inbound ACL commented out, while "
"the module sample is loopback-only. Directory users are **not** OS users."
msgstr ""
"**认证与授权**：SIP digest 加 ACL "
"列表（`conf/vanilla/autoload_configs/acl.conf.xml`、Sofia `apply-inbound-"
"acl`）。ESL 密码位于 `event_socket.conf.xml`（默认 `ClueCon`）；vanilla 绑定通配 `::` "
"且入站 ACL 被注释掉，而模块示例仅绑定 loopback。号码簿用户**不是**操作系统用户。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/01-architecture.md:1144
#: d18a7f995e0d45d38520d155869bc696
msgid ""
"**Error handling**: `switch_status_t` and hangup `switch_call_cause_t` on"
" the channel. Endpoints return `SWITCH_STATUS_FALSE` from a state handler"
" to skip the core’s standard handler (`sofia_on_init` comment)."
msgstr ""
"**错误处理**：通道上的 `switch_status_t` 与挂断 `switch_call_cause_t`。端点从状态处理函数返回 "
"`SWITCH_STATUS_FALSE` 以跳过核心的标准处理（见 `sofia_on_init` 注释）。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/01-architecture.md:1145
#: f74ff5d0fd8e4e6da040c95b5ecb16e3
msgid ""
"**Logging and tracing**: `switch_log_printf` with session UUID via "
"`SWITCH_CHANNEL_SESSION_LOG`. Sofia `siptrace` is a profile/CLI switch, "
"not distributed tracing. No OpenTelemetry in this tree."
msgstr ""
"**日志与追踪**：通过 `SWITCH_CHANNEL_SESSION_LOG` 带会话 UUID 的 "
"`switch_log_printf`。Sofia `siptrace` 是配置文件/CLI 开关，不是分布式追踪。本源码树没有 "
"OpenTelemetry。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/01-architecture.md:1146
#: 494979431c7249fab1d893a07c647611
msgid ""
"**Caching**: compiled XML root is memory-mapped (`freeswitch.xml.fsxml`);"
" `reloadxml` re-parses. Directory/ACL can be rebuilt from XML. RTP jitter"
" buffer is per-session, not a shared cache."
msgstr ""
"**缓存**：编译后的 XML 根以内存映射（`freeswitch.xml.fsxml`）；`reloadxml` 会重新解析。号码簿/ACL "
"可从 XML 重建。RTP 抖动缓冲是每会话的，不是共享缓存。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/01-architecture.md:1147
#: e49284b8a60a4243b41ae63c338f1046
msgid ""
"**Configuration and secrets**: XML under `confdir`; `vars.xml` "
"preprocessor `$$` vars (including `default_password`). Not a secret "
"manager. Change demo passwords before any public bind "
"(`conf/vanilla/README_IMPORTANT.txt`)."
msgstr ""
"**配置与密钥**：XML 位于 `confdir`；`vars.xml` 预处理器 `$$` 变量（包括 "
"`default_password`）。不是密钥管理器。对外绑定前请更改演示密码（`conf/vanilla/README_IMPORTANT.txt`）。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/01-architecture.md:1149
#: 07280f14fe38485881fa152c14ff7423
msgid "Deployment and Scaling Notes"
msgstr "部署与扩展说明"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/01-architecture.md:1151
#: 0919d9c3a1ff47a8b63252839e7a2978
msgid ""
"**Environments**: same binary; profile choice (`vanilla`, `sbc`, "
"`minimal`, `curl`) is the environment. CI builds on Debian containers, "
"macOS, Windows."
msgstr ""
"**环境**：同一二进制；配置档案选择（`vanilla`、`sbc`、`minimal`、`curl`）即环境。CI 在 Debian "
"容器、macOS、Windows 上构建。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/01-architecture.md:1152
#: bb911906984a4a9a9994c7b3349963f0
msgid ""
"**Scaling model**: **vertical** (more cores / less transcoding) and "
"**more processes/hosts** behind an SBC or Kamailio. Not a horizontally "
"sharded in-process cluster. RTP needs host networking in Docker "
"(`docker/README.md`)."
msgstr ""
"**扩展模型**：**纵向**（更多核 / 更少转码）以及在 SBC 或 Kamailio "
"后面部署**更多进程/主机**。不是进程内水平分片集群。Docker 中 RTP 需要主机网络（`docker/README.md`）。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/01-architecture.md:1153
#: 67dc4c2757404791a5f44b22277a9f7e
msgid ""
"**Recovery**: `-nonat` to skip UPnP pinholes; session recovery flags in "
"the state machine; core SQL can persist some state. Site HA, backups, and"
" RTO are **[NEEDS INPUT: operator-owned]** — not specified in this repo."
msgstr ""
"**恢复**：`-nonat` 跳过 UPnP 打洞；状态机中的会话恢复标志；核心 SQL 可持久化部分状态。站点 HA、备份和 RTO 为 "
"**[NEEDS INPUT: 由运营商自行负责]** —— 本仓库未规定。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/01-architecture.md:1155
